(Chapter I) Tj T*
(Article 1. Definitions) Tj T*
(A covered service stores customer-created records and offers them through a digital interface. The) Tj T*
(operator controls that service. A portable copy contains all customer-created records in an interoperable) Tj T*
(machine-readable format. A fulfillment provider is a separate entity selected by the operator to run its) Tj T*
(export software. These definitions apply throughout this instrument.) Tj T*
(Article 2. Export and portability) Tj T*
(1. The operator of a covered service must implement a software export function that produces a portable) Tj T*
(copy for a requesting customer. The operator must deliver the copy within seven calendar days after) Tj T*
(receiving the request.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
