stream
BT /F1 9 Tf 11 TL 42 756 Td
(The implemented export function and actual timely delivery are distinct aspects: configured software) Tj T*
(alone does not establish fulfillment of an individual request.) Tj T*
(2. The operator must not impose commercial charges or technical obstacles intended to prevent a customer) Tj T*
(moving their customer-created records to another service. For both charges and obstacles, this) Tj T*
(prohibition is limited to those intended to prevent that portability; it does not prohibit charges) Tj T*
(generally. The limited exception in Article 3\(2\) applies.) Tj T*
(Article 3. Remedy and exception) Tj T*
(1. If failure to perform Article 2\(1\) causes a customer documented financial loss, the operator must) Tj T*
(compensate that customer for the documented loss within thirty calendar days after receiving notice of) Tj T*
(the loss. A compensation policy alone does not perform this payment duty.) Tj T*
(2. As an exception to Article 2\(2\), the operator may temporarily block a transfer only while a) Tj T*
(documented, specific security threat makes that transfer unsafe. The block must be proportionate to that) Tj T*
(threat and end when the threat ends. This exception does not remove or delay the portable-copy duty in) Tj T*
(Article 2\(1\).) Tj T*
(Chapter II) Tj T*
(Article 4. Temporal transition) Tj T*
(This instrument takes effect on 1 January 2026. For covered services already operating before that date,) Tj T*
(the duties in Article 2\(1\) and Article 2\(2\) become applicable on 1 July 2026 after a six-month) Tj T*
(transition.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
